-- title:
--   Gauss integrality as localisation of the Kronecker ring at level Nq
-- statement:
--   Let $N \ge 1$ and let $q$ be a prime not dividing $N$. Let $A$ be a valuation subring of $\overline{\mathbb Q} =$ `AlgebraicClosure ℚ`, let $k$ be a field of characteristic $q$ and let $\mathrm{red} \colon A \to k$ be a ring homomorphism (no separate hypothesis that $A$ lies over $q$ is imposed: a homomorphism to a field of characteristic $q$ annihilates $q$, so $q$ is a non-unit of $A$). Let $f$ be an element of `modularFunctionFieldBar (N * q)`, the subfield of $\overline{\mathbb Q}((\mathfrak q))$ obtained from $\overline{\mathbb Q}$ by adjoining the coefficientwise images of the field $\mathbb Q(\mathrm{divisorExpansions}(N*q)) \subseteq \mathbb Q((\mathfrak q))$. Then the following are equivalent for the Laurent series underlying $f$. (1) There are Laurent series $x, y$ with coefficients in $A$ such that the coefficientwise reduction of $y$ along the residue map $A \to A/\mathfrak m_A$ is non-zero and $f \cdot y = x$ in $\overline{\mathbb Q}((\mathfrak q))$. (2) $f$ lies in `modularLocalized (N * q) A.toSubring red`, that is, there are $r, s$ in the subring $R \subseteq \overline{\mathbb Q}((\mathfrak q))$ generated by the constant series with coefficients in $A$ together with the two series `jqModC` and `jqNModC _ (N * q)` (the $\mathfrak q$-expansions of $j$ and of $j(\mathfrak q^{Nq})$), with $s$ outside the prime ideal `redKer` of $R$ attached to $\mathrm{red}$, and $f \cdot s = r$.
--
--   This is the comparison, at level $Nq$ with $q \nmid N$, between integrality for the Gauss valuation on $\overline{\mathbb Q}((\mathfrak q))$ and membership in the localisation of the plane Kronecker presentation ring $A[j, j(\mathfrak q^{Nq})]$ at the prime corresponding to the component of the fibre at $q$ through the cusp $\infty$; it expresses the normality of that model at the relevant generic point. It provides the integrality dictionary for the regular prolongation produced by [`ModularCurve.exists_regularProlongation_modularFunctionFieldBar_mul_of_not_dvd`](thm.html#ModularCurve.exists_regularProlongation_modularFunctionFieldBar_mul_of_not_dvd), and is used in [`ModularCurve.isIntegral_jRing_of_coeffMap_eq_of_isIntegral_adjoin_of_not_dvd`](thm.html#ModularCurve.isIntegral_jRing_of_coeffMap_eq_of_isIntegral_adjoin_of_not_dvd).
-- source:
